commit 27dc7b5026dce1af6e4f72b63b471634957d5cd9

C03: settings finals no longer see the provenance token; an affirmed extreme contradicted by the read is vetoed (BRIGHT1321)

BRIGHT1319 measured two composer defects. H0430: the visible payload of system.settings.set carried authority=wmi_monitor_brightness_postread and the model copied «WMI» into every final (forbidden term, retries exhausted). H0674: «El brillo está en el máximo.» was published with an observed value of 60.

llm compose payload: system.settings.* drop authority and the monitor instanceName from the narrator's copy (the canonical observation and the checks keep them).
llm._payload_fact_defect: contradicted_maximum / contradicted_minimum when the draft affirms máximo/mínimo/100 %/0 % and the observed brightness values do not reach it; a negated extreme («no está al máximo») passes. Hints for both.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


